[
  {"id":"3849677396858052789","shortcode":"DVszTIrkyC1","text":"＼1週間で200人が参加／\n引き寄せの極秘情報を配信中や\nワイの願望実現部屋はコメ欄から入れるで↓\n✨今なら「おさぼり宇宙人流引き寄せ術」を読めるで","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/DVszTIrkyC1","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-03-10T10:08:49Z","like_count":28,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.170632837Z"},
  {"id":"3955863199077794232","shortcode":"DbmDJ7ZEoG4","text":"正直、これ知ってるもん勝ちやで。深呼吸は「吸う」ことばっかり意識されがちやけど、実は「吐く」方を長くするだけで金運の周波数が変わるんや。借金500万で息すら浅かったワイが変わった話するわ↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/DbmDJ7ZEoG4","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-08-03T22:21:12Z","like_count":11,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.17066526Z"},
  {"id":"3955580848691103952","shortcode":"DblC9MGkkjQ","text":"ちょっと想像してみ。仕事から帰ってきたら、玄関に見覚えのない荷物が置いてある。差出人の名前を見ても心当たりがない。でも開けたら、ちゃんと欲しかったもんやったんや。それがワイの日常やで↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/DblC9MGkkjQ","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-08-03T13:00:12Z","like_count":9,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.170678122Z"},
  {"id":"3955578818656397717","shortcode":"DblCfpfEumV","text":"これガチなんやけど、スマホの待ち受けに「欲しい車」「欲しい家」の画像を設定してる人ほど、実は願いが叶うの遅いんや。借金500万の頃のワイの待ち受けも、まさにコレやったで↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/DblCfpfEumV","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-08-03T12:56:12Z","like_count":7,"reply_count":3,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.170690402Z"},
  {"id":"3955520478102292140","shortcode":"Dbk1OrnEgas","text":"ちょっと、信じられんかもしれんけど実話や。借金500万で藁にもすがる思いで宝くじ売り場に並んでたら、店員のおばちゃんに突然話しかけられたんや。あの一言、今でも忘れられへんで↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/Dbk1OrnEgas","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-08-03T11:00:17Z","like_count":7,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.170704415Z"},
  {"id":"3955495980590309609","shortcode":"DbkvqMhkiDp","text":"こっそり教えるけど、玄関を見たらその人の金運の「入り口」の状態がだいたい分かるんや。借金500万の頃のワイの玄関、靴が散乱して完全に「入るな」って空気やったで↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/DbkvqMhkiDp","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-08-03T10:11:37Z","like_count":10,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.170715844Z"},
  {"id":"3944264716331920643","shortcode":"Da819ylEi0D","text":"正直、これ知ってるもん勝ちやで。宇宙銀行にはあんた専用のパスワードがあるんやけど、「欠乏感」を出し続けると自動でロックがかかる仕組みになっとるんや。借金500万時代のワイ、完全ロックされてたわ↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/Da819ylEi0D","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-07-18T22:17:04Z","like_count":6,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.170726652Z"},
  {"id":"3944003793755219384","shortcode":"Da76o3fkqW4","text":"ちょっと恥ずかしい話、正直に言うわ。ワイ、毎朝起きた瞬間に天井に向かって唱えてる言葉があるんや。借金500万で朝起きるのすら辛かった頃に師匠から教わったやつやで↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/Da76o3fkqW4","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-07-18T13:38:40Z","like_count":5,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.170736899Z"},
  {"id":"3943984440666152514","shortcode":"Da72PPhkt5C","text":"こっそり教えるけど、冷蔵庫の中を見たら、その人の金運状態がだいたい分かるんや。借金500万で余裕がなかった頃のワイの冷蔵庫、控えめに言ってマジで完全に地獄やったで↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/Da72PPhkt5C","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-07-18T13:00:12Z","like_count":5,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.170751623Z"},
  {"id":"3943976138762754857","shortcode":"Da70Wbxkhsp","text":"師匠に言われた一言で、金運への罪悪感が全部消えたんや。「お金に良いも悪いもない、ただのエネルギーや」って。借金500万で自分を責め続けてたワイには、衝撃の一言やった↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/Da70Wbxkhsp","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-07-18T12:43:44Z","like_count":4,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.170763483Z"},
  {"id":"3943804272190293250","shortcode":"Da7NRcjkgUC","text":"これ、マジでヤバい話や。素粒子ってな、誰かが見るまで「どこにあるか」すら決まってへんらしいんよ。この事実、借金500万から逆転したワイの人生観を全部変えたんや↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/Da7NRcjkgUC","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-07-18T07:02:16Z","like_count":8,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.1707738Z"},
  {"id":"3943686385689596775","shortcode":"Da6yd-MkpNn","text":"あんま言いたくないんやけど、「マメだね」って周りから褒められがちな人、実はソレ、金運下げとる可能性高いで。借金500万の頃のワイ、めちゃくちゃマメな性格やったんや↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/Da6yd-MkpNn","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-07-18T03:08:04Z","like_count":4,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.170787763Z"},
  {"id":"3943569249264646551","shortcode":"Da6X1aZkrmX","text":"ちょっと想像してみ。スマホの通帳アプリに通知が来て開いたら、身に覚えのない入金が記録されてる。金額を二度見するけど、間違いやない。それがワイの「いつもの朝」やで↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/Da6X1aZkrmX","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-07-17T23:15:17Z","like_count":2,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.17079811Z"},
  {"id":"3943559111371786106","shortcode":"Da6Vh4wEgd6","text":"これガチなんやけど、引き寄せノートを毎日几帳面に、丁寧な字でびっしり書いてる人ほど願いが叶うの遅いんや。借金500万時代のワイもノート魔やったけど、逆効果やったで↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/Da6Vh4wEgd6","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-07-17T22:55:09Z","like_count":2,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.170808027Z"},
  {"id":"3943274763137456208","shortcode":"Da5U4E0khhQ","text":"ちょっと、信じられんかもしれんけど実話や。借金500万で全部投げ出したくなって、平日の朝から二度寝を決め込んだ日があった。起きた瞬間、鳴ってた電話の内容、聞いたら鳥肌立つで↓","media_type":"TEXT_POST","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@osabori_space_human/post/Da5U4E0khhQ","username":"osabori_space_human","user_id":"80429967765","timestamp":"2026-07-17T13:30:13Z","like_count":5,"reply_count":2,"repost_count":0,"quote_count":0,"fetched_at":"2026-08-31T11:34:23.170818033Z"}
]
